Create a policy and apply to an Object Bucket with the S3 protocol.

USAGE:
  scw object bucket-policy create <bucket ...> [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  bucket            The name of the bucket to which assign the policy.
  policy-path       The path to the local JSON file containing the bucket policy.
  [project-id]      Project ID to use. If none is passed the default project ID will be used
  [region=fr-par]   Region to target. If none is passed will use default region from the config

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for create
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
